          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the whole earth had one language and few words. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as men migrated from the east, they found a plain in the land of Shinar and settled there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they said to one another, “Come, let us make bricks, and burn them thoroughly.” And they had brick for stone, and bitumen for mortar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they said, “Come, let us build ourselves a city, and a tower with its top in the heavens, and let us make a name for ourselves, lest we be scattered abroad upon the face of the whole earth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came down to see the city and the tower, which the sons of men had built. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Behold, they are one people, and they have all one language; and this is only the beginning of what they will do; and nothing that they propose to do will now be impossible for them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come, let us go down, and there confuse their language, that they may not understand one another's speech.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " scattered them abroad from there over the face of all the earth, and they left off building the city. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore its name was called Babel, because there the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " confused",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Compare Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "balal,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "confuse",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the language of all the earth; and from there the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
