        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now these are the descendants of Terah. Terah was the father of Abram, Nahor, and Haran; and Haran was the father of Lot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haran died before his father Terah in the land of his birth, in Ur of the Chaldeans. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abram and Nahor took wives; the name of Abram's wife was Sarai, and the name of Nahor's wife, Milcah, the daughter of Haran the father of Milcah and Iscah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Sarai was barren; she had no child.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
